<title>ITALY: Lira weakens slightly on Dini remarks.</title>
<headline>Lira weakens slightly on Dini remarks.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The lira weakened slightly against the mark after Foreign Minister Lamberto Dini said there could be a possible delay in the launch of European economic and monetary union (EMU) beyond January 1999.</p>
<p>The lira was quoted at 993.350/3.80 shortly after Dini's comments were made public compared with 992.50/2.85 at the opening.</p>
<p>Dini said the EMU launch could be put back by up to six months to allow more countries to join.</p>
<p>Milan newsroom +392-66102321</p>
